- convert all notebools to a library plus a small notebook to call.
- pymefpp_solve: Modify sextractor in the solve library to permit modification of some parameters.
- pymefpp_run: Add QC parameters to save quality parameters
- pymefpp_run: Use mode to determine sky level in each of the frames
- pymefpp_run: Normalize by exposure time and add a MEFPP keyword to keep track of 
  original exposure time and the saturation level.
- pymefpp_run: change to counts using the average gain.
